db.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11frj.jpg"}], "slug": "rhem-2-the-cave", "storyline": "The game opens with the player's arrival in a series of caves underneath the city of Rhem. A video greeting from another explorer, Kales, explains that the player must find an artifact hidden somewhere within the caverns, take a photograph of it, and bring the photo to Kales's brother Zetais. The player must find the artifact in order to unlock the train and leave Rhem.", "summary": "RHEM 2 is an adventure game from Knut M\u00fcller and Got Game Entertainment and the sequel to RHEM. It is distributed as a Macromedia Director file.\n\nLike Myst and Riven, Rhem 2 is a node-based first-person adventure game. The player explores a series of caverns in search of a certain artifact. The puzzles involve spatial reasoning, operating machinery, and logic.", "themes": [{"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/rhem-2-the-cave", "videos": [{"id": 174189, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "D3EX5PfcuG0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D3EX5PfcuG0", "title": "Let's Play RHEM 2 - Part 1 - Into Darkness", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/D3EX5PfcuG0/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2391, "name": "Rhem"}]}